OL,3,GNEWSAFive WW2 soldiers named and
OL,4,Ahonoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive British soldiers killed in the
OL,7,Faftermath of D-Day during World War Two
OL,8,Fhave finally been identified, with
OL,9,Fservices held for them in northern
OL,10,FFrance.
OL,12,FPrivates George Chapman and Vincent
OL,13,FCoia, L/Cpl Reginald Dewey, Cpl Henry
OL,14,FRead and Sjt Frederick Albert Harrison
OL,15,Fwere buried as unknown soldiers after
OL,16,Fbeing killed at separate locations
OL,17,Fduring the Battle of Normandy, which
OL,18,Ffollowed the June 1944 landings.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
