OL,3,GNEWSAFive WW2 soldiers named and
OL,4,Ahonoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Commonwealth War Graves Commission
OL,7,F(CWGC) has now replaced their
OL,8,Fheadstones with new ones bearing their
OL,9,Fnames.
OL,11,FEarlier this week, relatives of some of
OL,12,Fthe men attended services in France,
OL,13,Fwith the 95-year-old brother of Sjt
OL,14,FHarrison sending a message stating:
OL,15,F"I'm very proud of him."
